{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56801","headline":"卢携梦人赠句（题拟） · 不详","name":"卢携梦人赠句（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"若问登庸日，庭椿不染风。\n（见冯贽《云仙杂记》卷五引《凤池编》）（〖1〗《凤池编》云：「卢携梦人赠句曰〖略〗。\n初不解其言，後数年携拜相，庭下古椿一株，虽狂风骤雨，不湿不摇。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56801.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56801","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}